{"unit_id":"tag:03YA:title","translation":"平坦局部完全交（Syntomic）拓扑（topology）","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Syntomic","target_term":"平坦局部完全交"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"Syntomic","target_term":"平坦局部完全交","context":"syntomic 性质的暂定译名；待批准。"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑","context":"本节拓扑；待批准。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:03YA:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n本节讨论代数空间（algebraic spaces）的平坦局部完全交（syntomic）覆盖（covering）概念，并定义代数空间（algebraic space）的大平坦局部完全交（syntomic）位点（site）。请与《拓扑（Topologies）》第<REF_0001>节比较。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"平坦局部完全交"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"平坦局部完全交"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"拓扑"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"覆盖的对象；待批准。"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"平坦局部完全交","context":"syntomic 性质的暂定译名；待批准。"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"所讨论的覆盖；待批准。"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间","context":"位点对应的空间；待批准。"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点","context":"所定义的大位点；待批准。"},{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"拓扑","context":"章节标题；待批准。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:041A:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是概形（scheme），并设<MATH_0002>是<MATH_0003>上的代数空间（algebraic space）。所谓<TEXTITOPEN_0001>平坦局部完全交覆盖（syntomic covering），覆盖空间<MATH_0004><TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，是态射族（family of morphisms）<MATH_0005>，由<MATH_0006>上的代数空间（algebraic spaces）之间的态射组成，满足每个<MATH_0007>都是平坦局部完全交（syntomic）的，并且\n<MATH_0008>\n即这些态射（morphisms）联合为满射（surjective）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"syntomic covering","target_term":"平坦局部完全交覆盖"},{"source_term":"family of morphisms","target_term":"态射族"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"平坦局部完全交"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"基概形；待批准。"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间","context":"被覆盖的空间；待批准。"},{"source_term":"syntomic covering","target_term":"平坦局部完全交覆盖","context":"syntomic 覆盖的暂定译名；待批准。"},{"source_term":"family of morphisms","target_term":"态射族","context":"覆盖中的态射族；待批准。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"覆盖中的空间；待批准。"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"平坦局部完全交","context":"覆盖态射的性质；待批准。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"覆盖的各态射；待批准。"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"联合满射性；待批准。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:03YA:prose-0002","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n这与《拓扑（Topologies）》定义<REF_0001>完全相同。特别地，如果<MATH_0001>及所有<MATH_0002>都是概形（schemes），则恢复了通常的概形（schemes）的平坦局部完全交（syntomic）覆盖（covering）概念。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"平坦局部完全交"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"拓扑","context":"章节标题；待批准。"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"通常覆盖定义的对象；待批准。"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"平坦局部完全交","context":"syntomic 性质的暂定译名；待批准。"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"概形的覆盖；待批准。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0DFB:statement","translation":"任意光滑（smooth）覆盖（covering）都是平坦局部完全交（syntomic）覆盖（covering），从而任意平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）或 Zariski 覆盖（Zariski covering）更是平坦局部完全交（syntomic）覆盖（covering）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"平坦局部完全交"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"Zariski covering","target_term":"Zariski 覆盖"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"平坦局部完全交"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑","context":"引理的假设；待批准。"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"所比较的覆盖；待批准。"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"平坦局部完全交","context":"syntomic 性质的暂定译名；待批准。"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"进一步的情形；待批准。"},{"source_term":"Zariski covering","target_term":"Zariski 覆盖","context":"进一步的情形；待批准。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0DFB:proof","translation":"这由定义及光滑（smooth）态射（morphism）是平坦局部完全交（syntomic）的这一事实（《代数空间的态射（Morphisms）》引理<REF_0001>）以及引理<REF_0002>可知。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"平坦局部完全交"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑","context":"所用的态射性质；待批准。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"光滑态射；待批准。"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"平坦局部完全交","context":"syntomic 性质的暂定译名；待批准。"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"章节标题；待批准。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:041B:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>是<MATH_0003>上的代数空间（algebraic space）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002>若<MATH_0004>是同构（isomorphism），则<MATH_0005>是平坦局部完全交（syntomic）覆盖（covering），覆盖<MATH_0006>。\n<STRUCT_0003>若<MATH_0007>是平坦局部完全交（syntomic）覆盖（covering），并且对每个<MATH_0008>都有一个平坦局部完全交（syntomic）覆盖（covering）<MATH_0009>，则<MATH_0010>是平坦局部完全交（syntomic）覆盖（covering）。\n<STRUCT_0004>若<MATH_0011>是平坦局部完全交（syntomic）覆盖（covering），且<MATH_0012>是代数空间（algebraic spaces）的态射（morphism），则<MATH_0013>是平坦局部完全交（syntomic）覆盖（covering）。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"平坦局部完全交"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"平坦局部完全交"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"平坦局部完全交"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"平坦局部完全交"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"平坦局部完全交"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"平坦局部完全交"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"基概形；待批准。"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间","context":"覆盖的对象；待批准。"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构","context":"第一个覆盖公理；待批准。"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"平坦局部完全交","context":"syntomic 性质的暂定译名；待批准。"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"覆盖公理中的覆盖；待批准。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"拉回态射的源与目标；待批准。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"拉回所沿的态射；待批准。"}],"notes":[]}
